    "Drape the blue scarf loosely over your shoulders as a bolero-style layer, letting it fall asymmetrically to add volume at the top without widening your hips.",
    "Tuck the front of the olive sweater neatly into the waistband of the trousers to highlight your marked waist and keep the silhouette clean for your movement."
